
  <main id="main">

    <section class="page-head industry-head">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow">For cleaning services</span>
        <h1>Quote in seconds. Book in one tap.</h1>
        <p class="lead">Every cleaning enquiry starts with &quot;how much for a 3-bedroom house?&quot;. Put the answer on your site and the serious clients book themselves in.</p>
        <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:1.4rem">
          <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary btn--large" data-mockup-open data-mockup-hint="e.g. Nomsa&#x27;s Cleaning — homes and offices in Pretoria East, weekly and once-off">Get a free mockup of your cleaning business site</button>
          <a href="#pricing" class="btn btn--ghost btn--large">See what it costs</a>
        </div>
        <p class="hero__freebie"><span class="hero__freebie-tag">Free</span> We build a preview of your cleaning business site first — no deposit, no obligation. Projects from R1,000; R500 to start, refundable until you approve the quote.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="wantsTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">What your customers check first</span><h2 id="wantsTitle">Three things every cleaning business website has to do.</h2></div>
        <div class="grid grid--3">
          <div class="card reveal"><span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg></span><h3>A price without a phone call</h3><p>An instant quote: rooms, frequency, extras — and a number. The ones who message after that are ready to book.</p></div>
          <div class="card reveal"><span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg></span><h3>Proof you&#x27;re reliable</h3><p>Reviews, a real photo of you or the team, and what&#x27;s included. Trust is the whole sale in cleaning.</p></div>
          <div class="card reveal"><span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg></span><h3>Easy repeat bookings</h3><p>Weekly or monthly clients want to rebook in one tap, not re-explain everything each time.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section--tint" aria-labelledby="buildTitle">
      <div class="container service__grid">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">What we'd build</span>
          <h2 id="buildTitle">A cleaning business site that does the selling for you.</h2>
          <ul class="tick-list">
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> <span>A one-page site with services, areas and what&#x27;s included</span></li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> <span>An instant quote tool customers can send to you on WhatsApp</span></li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> <span>Booking via WhatsApp, or a proper booking form with dates</span></li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> <span>Reviews and before/after photos</span></li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> <span>Optional: monthly invoicing and reminders for regular clients</span></li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> <span>Google Business Profile so you appear for &quot;cleaning services near me&quot;</span></li>
          </ul>
          <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:1.2rem"><a href="start?type=Website" class="btn btn--primary">Start a Project</a><button type="button" class="btn btn--ghost" data-mockup-open data-mockup-hint="e.g. Nomsa&#x27;s Cleaning — homes and offices in Pretoria East, weekly and once-off">Free mockup first</button></div>
        </div>
        <a class="card card--link work-card reveal" href="demos#invoice">
          <img class="work-card__img" src="assets/demo-invoice.png" alt="Screenshot of the Nomsa&#x27;s Cleaning Services — Instant Quote demo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          <div class="work-card__body">
            <div class="work-card__meta"><span class="badge badge--concept">Live demo</span><span class="tag tag--muted">Website</span></div>
            <h3>Nomsa&#x27;s Cleaning Services — Instant Quote</h3>
            <p>A demo where a customer picks the size of the home and extras and gets a quote they can send on WhatsApp.</p>
            <div class="card__foot"><span class="card__more">See it live</span></div>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="pricing" aria-labelledby="priceTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">What it costs</span><h2 id="priceTitle">Fixed prices. Nothing starts until you've approved a quote.</h2></div>
        <div class="grid grid--2 industry-pricing">
          <ul class="price-list reveal">
            <li><div class="pl-name">Quick cleaning site<small>One page: services, areas, what&#x27;s included, WhatsApp booking</small></div><span class="price"><small>from</small>R1,000</span></li>
            <li><div class="pl-name">Business website<small>4–5 pages, service pages, reviews, gallery, booking form</small></div><span class="price"><small>from</small>R2,000</span></li>
            <li><div class="pl-name">Site with instant quote tool<small>Customers quote themselves; regulars rebook and get reminders</small></div><span class="price"><small>from</small>R4,500</span></li>
            <li><div class="pl-name">Hosting &amp; care<small>Keeps the site online; small updates included on the Care plan</small></div><span class="price"><small>from</small>R400<span class="per">/yr</span></span></li>
          </ul>
          <div class="card card--tint reveal">
            <h3>First year, all in</h3>
            <p>A quick cleaning business site (R1,000) plus a year of hosting (R400) is <strong>R1,400</strong>. Pay R500 to start; the rest on approval of the fixed quote. Domain and any third-party fees are separate and agreed first.</p>
            <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:0.8rem">Prices are starting points for typical cleaners. Your quote is fixed before we begin. <a class="inline-link" href="pricing">Full price list →</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section--tint" aria-labelledby="howTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">How it works</span><h2 id="howTitle">From "we should really have a website" to live.</h2></div>
        <ol class="steps reveal">
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">1</span><h3>Free mockup</h3><p>Tell us about your cleaning business. We build a preview so you can see it before deciding anything.</p></li>
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">2</span><h3>R500 to start</h3><p>Like the direction? R500 reserves your slot — refundable until you approve the quote.</p></li>
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">3</span><h3>Fixed quote</h3><p>We confirm exactly what's included and the price. No surprises later.</p></li>
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">4</span><h3>Build &amp; launch</h3><p>Quick sites go live in days. You own the domain; we host and look after it if you want.</p></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="faqTitle">
      <div class="container container--narrow">
        <div class="section__head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Questions cleaners ask</span><h2 id="faqTitle">Straight answers.</h2></div>
        <div class="faq reveal">
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Can the quote tool use my real prices?</summary><p>Yes. You give us your rates per room, frequency and extras; the tool calculates from those, and we can change them any time.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Can clients pay online?</summary><p>Yes, if you want that — deposits or full payment through Yoco. Many cleaning businesses prefer EFT after the job, and that works too.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Do I need a logo?</summary><p>No. We&#x27;ll make a clean text logo to start, and you can replace it later.</p></details>
        </div>
        <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:1.2rem">More in the <a class="inline-link" href="/#faq">general FAQ</a>. Also built for: <a class="inline-link" href="for-salons">Hair &amp; beauty salons</a> · <a class="inline-link" href="for-plumbers">Plumbers &amp; trades</a> · <a class="inline-link" href="for-restaurants">Restaurants &amp; takeaways</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta" aria-labelledby="ctaTitle">
      <div class="container cta__inner reveal">
        <span class="cta__services">For cleaning services</span>
        <h2 id="ctaTitle">See your cleaning business online before you pay a cent.</h2>
        <p>Give us the name, what you do and what you'd like on the site. We'll send a free preview.</p>
        <div class="btn-row btn-row--center">
          <button type="button" class="btn btn--light btn--large" data-mockup-open data-mockup-hint="e.g. Nomsa&#x27;s Cleaning — homes and offices in Pretoria East, weekly and once-off">Get a free mockup</button>
          <a href="start?type=Website" class="btn btn--ghost-light btn--large">Start a Project</a>
        </div>
        <p class="small muted" data-contact-block hidden>Prefer to talk first? <a class="inline-link" href="#" data-contact="whatsapp" hidden>WhatsApp us</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
